#14438
The Quiet Tunnels~
This tunnel is much smaller than any of the others.  They have been made with
the same care and craft of the others but you notice very few goblins make
their way through here.  Most of them appear to guards, shamans,  or
engineers.  It is oddly quiet, several runes of power burned into the ground
must create a barrier.
~
